  "text": "```systemverilog\nmodule sync #(\n    parameter int unsigned STAGES = 2,\n    parameter bit ResetValue = 1'b0\n) (\n    input  logic clk_i,\n    input  logic rst_ni,\n    input  logic serial_i,\n    output logic serial_o\n);\n\n    logic [STAGES-1:0] sync_reg;\n\n    genvar i;\n    generate\n        for (i = 0; i < STAGES; i = i + 1) begin : stage\n            assign sync_reg[i] = (i == STAGES - 1) ? serial_o : sync_reg[i+1];\n            \n            always_ff @(posedge clk_i or negedge rst_ni) begin\n                if (!rst_ni) begin\n                    sync_reg[i] <= ResetValue;\n                end else begin\n                    sync_reg[i] <= (i == 0) ? serial_i : sync_reg[i+1];\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    endgenerate\n\n    assign serial_o = sync_reg[0];\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>\n<|endoftext|>",
